### Login
POST https://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Get Hosts
GET https://localhost:8080/api/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create VM
POST https://localhost:8080/api/vms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "vm-sample",
  "cpuCores": 2,
  "memoryMb": 4096,
  "storageGb": 50,
  "osImage": "win2022-core"
}
